    "market_commentary": "A further weekly decline, of 1,167 points, saw the SSY Pacific Capesize Index retreat to a six-month low of 5,189. The W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate dropped by $1.90/t to $7.85/t, while the round-voyage rate almost halved to $5,800/day.",
